{"type":"message","id":"932231bb","parentId":"5ea6d08a","timestamp":"2026-04-08T05:02:35.849Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_function_4h9f0clnj5l0_2","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# 每日行业信息 - 2026年4月7日\n\n## 搜索主题\n1. 酒店行业最新动态（携程、美团、飞猪等）\n2. AI Agent最新技术/产品\n3. 德拢集团相关新闻\n\n---\n\n## 提炼：3条最重要信息\n\n### 1. 【酒店行业】德胧集团发布\"神灯AI\"，AI重塑酒店业生态\n- 3月30日，德胧集团在深圳召开2026战略发布会，发布\"虫洞战略体系\"核心——**\"神灯AI\"**（百达屋APP超级员工）\n- 同时发布**\"天干地支\"客户体验进化模型**，为中国酒店业转型升级提供可落地、可复制的实践样本\n- **关联公司：天津瑞湾开元名都酒店**（属德胧集团开元旗下）\n- 来源：德胧集团2026战略发布会、中华网等\n\n### 2. 【旅游消费】清明假期酒店预订量激增40%，亲子游引爆春游市场\n- **飞猪**：清明假期国内酒店预订量同比增长约40%；出境游玩乐项目订单数增幅超20倍\n- **美团**：南京亲子民宿订单量同比增长超10倍，成都增速超7倍；北京民宿同比增长234%\n- **携程**：入境游订单数同比增长接近翻倍\n- 同程、飞猪等平台整体旅游产品预订热度环比上涨近一倍\n- 背景：2026年春假清明6天连休，亲子家庭800公里以上长线游成为主力\n\n### 3. 【行业监管】4月起大数据杀熟、强制自动续费全面叫停\n- **文旅部与市场监管总局联合修订《旅游住宿业服务规范》**，4月1日起实施\n- **新规要点**：\n  - 所有互联网平台（携程、飞猪、美团等）禁止大数据杀熟\n  - 禁止强制自动续费，需明示并获用户同意\n  - 酒店线上展示信息必须真实，房型、设施等信息公示全流程覆盖\n  - 航司座位管理：国内航班免费可选座位比例不低于70%\n- 此外，**美团受益于携程反垄断调查**，竞争格局变化有助于美团缩小与携程在酒店供给方面的差距\n\n---\n\n## 附：AI Agent领域动态摘要\n- **扣子2.5**（字节）：2026年4月7日发布AI Agent协作平台Agent World，定位\"满配职场伙伴\"\n- **Nvidia GTC 2026**：发布AI Agent Toolkit，联合17家企业（Adobe、Salesforce、SAP等）\n- **Meta Llama 4**：2026年4月3日发布，4000亿参数，MoE架构，MMLU得分89.7%超越GPT-4，完全免费商用\n- **OpenClaw v2026.4.5**：新增支持智谱AI GLM-4.6、Ollama本地模型；字节跳动宣布赞助OpenClaw\n- **Cursor 3**：AI编程进入\"智能体集群\"新纪元；阿里同步发布Qwen3.6-plus，支持百万字符超长上下文\n\n---\n\n*记录时间：2026-04-08 09:00（每日行业信息搜索任务）*\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1775624555848}}
{"type":"message","id":"5a125b6b","parentId":"932231bb","timestamp":"2026-04-08T05:02:55.898Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now I have the context from the group learning tracker. Let me analyze:\n\n1. **Last check time**: 2026-04-08 12:02 - the most recent check\n2. **Already learned groups**: Many groups have been learned already\n3. **Current time**: 2026-04-08 13:02\n\nSo I need to search for groups with messages in the last 24 hours (from 2026-04-07 13:02 onwards), focusing on new messages since the 12:02 check.\n\nThe key groups already learned include:\n- TJ-酒店客房预订群 (most recent: 12:01 rocket army order)\n\n\n- TJ-酒店市场工作沟通开壳群 (most recent: 10:07-10:13 content)\n- Various other groups\n\nSince the last check at 12:02, I should look for any new messages that came in during the past hour from 12:02 to 13:02. The most recent activity was the rocket army order in the TJ-酒店客房预订群 at 12:01, so I need to check if there are any newer messages after that timestamp.\n\nLooking at the timing more carefully, this cron job is scheduled for 13:02, which is an hour after the previous check. That means I'm looking for messages from the past hour across all groups. Let me search the hotel-related groups to see what new activity has occurred.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"已读取追踪记录，上次检查是12:02。现在搜索13:02前的新消息。\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_6n9x42jg8gxi_1","name":"feishu_im_user_get_messages","arguments":{"chat_id":"oc_fe89d2c0436adf59c54747a10131a045","page_size":20,"sort_rule":"create_time_desc"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_6n9x42jg8gxi_2","name":"feishu_im_user_get_messages","arguments":{"chat_id":"oc_10122aa30da1d9bc64b365dadb3b6dbb","page_size":20,"sort_rule":"create_time_desc"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_6n9x42jg8gxi_3","name":"feishu_im_user_get_messages","arguments":{"chat_id":"oc_4e890ccbd87ec2216e47c009e523676d","page_size":20,"sort_rule":"create_time_desc"}},