{"type":"message","id":"6c1e9e32","parentId":"e573163a","timestamp":"2026-04-08T05:02:57.128Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_function_6n9x42jg8gxi_3","toolName":"feishu_im_user_get_messages","content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\n  \"messages\": [\n    {\n      \"message_id\": \"om_x100b526ebddbc8b8c22bfaa5175b3e4\",\n      \"msg_type\": \"post\",\n      \"content\": \"截止周三：\\n![image](img_v3_0210i_3a961a9b-66f6-4e29-9fb8-5f86340b3a8g)\\n本周售卡环比下滑严重的门店@俞利军 @吴姜 @李昆 @邵世骏 @顾明 \\n![image](img_v3_0210i_6589263b-00aa-4834-b2da-e2fd5375fc5g)\\n本周APP下载率环比下滑严重的门店@张熙然 @黄承 @晁留柱 @张成 @俞利军 \\n![image](img_v3_0210i_6f31a3ff-ad12-48bb-ae2c-65684be682bg)\\n本周售卡动销率0的门店@张波 @彭亮 @梁军 @蔡炬炯 @甘亮 @张良强 @李禧 @姚芸 @张成 \\n以上门店及总经理，还请重点关注对应营销数据追赶！尤其针对OTA宾客的强感知发展及售卡动作\",\n      \"sender\": {\n        \"id\": \"ou_6490bbac2236c018926c92f71cd0bacd\",\n        \"sender_type\": \"user\",\n        \"name\": \"张春雷\"\n      },\n      \"create_time\": \"2026-04-08T09:28:17+08:00\",\n      \"deleted\": false,\n      \"updated\": true,\n      \"mentions\": [\n        {\n          \"key\": \"@_user_1\",\n          \"id\": \"ou_cfad75d1e6e4b69aeb14b89610da8a6a\",\n          \"name\": \"俞利军\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"key\": \"@_user_2\",\n          \"id\": \"ou_c3f9e56b23bf4a0bfb6a4fdea8ed3e79\",\n          \"name\": \"吴姜\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"key\": \"@_user_3\",\n          \"id\": \"ou_41c1de197bed6caab041d6deb2ee5456\",\n          \"name\": \"李昆\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"key\": \"@_user_4\",\n          \"id\": \"ou_76134d6ecd00e7740a8c330d2050078a\",\n          \"name\": \"邵世骏\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"key\": \"@_user_5\",\n          \"id\": \"ou_b091d3ab1f0ddcdfe7e994bc5eba6293\",\n          \"name\": \"顾明\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"key\": \"@_user_6\",\n          \"id\": \"ou_7f586325f8b8a6204a6c368384ebc25d\",\n          \"name\": \"张熙然\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"key\": \"@_user_7\",\n          \"id\": \"ou_be1516db3b