7 神灯上线酒店数（40%） 19 19 19 19 19 19 神灯活跃对话房间数 444 1,673 2,718 1,715 1,503 1,463 反馈总量 1,234 5,458 9,541 5,468 4,375 4,246 神灯活跃率 46.3% \n**发件人：**\n英宁 <­yingning@delonixmail.com­>\n**时间：**\n2026-04-07T10:01:02.573Z（2026-04-07T10:01:02.573Z）2026-04-07T10:01:02.573Z\n</card>","sender":{"id":"ou_42cf24dd179f2f2ef36952cab65f5aee","sender_type":"user","name":"方源兵"},"create_time":"2026-04-07T18:04:49+08:00","deleted":false,"updated":false},{"message_id":"om_x100b5278503ee114b21a4e239f924a0","msg_type":"text","content":"<p>各位总经理下上好，现将3月29日--4月4日虫洞门店周报发送给各位，请及时接收并审阅。另神灯活跃率低于 50% 的酒店烦请重点关注下，感谢各位的支持！谢谢。</p>","sender":{"id":"ou_42cf24dd179f2f2ef36952cab65f5aee","sender_type":"user","name":"方源兵"},"create_time":"2026-04-07T16:35:59+08:00","deleted":false,"updated":true},{"message_id":"om_x100b5278524904b4b36268e5330631d","msg_type":"interactive","content":"<card title=\"【周报】虫洞门店服务周报（3.29-4.4）\">\nDear all： 以下为虫洞（3.29-4.4）数据收集情况，请查收。 一、周度工单数据概览 虫洞直营店（29家） 虫洞直营店 指标 数据 3.29-4.4 3.22-3.28 3.15-3.21 3.8-3.14 3.1-3.7 2.22-2.28 2.15-2.21 2.8-2.14 2.1-2.7 1.25-1.31 1.18-1.24 1.11-1.17 1.4-1.10 12.28-1.3 12.21-12.27 12.14-12.20 12.7-12.13 11.30-12.6 神灯使用 酒店数 29 29 29 29 29 29 30 30 29 29 29 29 29 27 26 25 26 26 神灯活跃对话房间数 14,906 14,067 15,157 13,567 9,924 8,938 17,293 7,438 8,406 7,549 4,476 3,658 2,508 2,511 1,350 1,350 1,209 858 工单总数 36,464 29,651 32,108 29,645 21,909 23,094 50,510 20,185 20,054 17,093 10,468 8,426 5,787 5,595 2,649 2,629 2,406 1,626 神灯活跃率 59% 56% 58% 58% 54% 53% 55% 50% 40% 37% 23% 19% 14% 11% 7% 6% 6% 4% 工单执行 客服与AI执行 AI执行 47% 53% 53% 53% 47% 33% 29% 27% 32% 31% 28% 26% 26% 29% 30% 30% 27% 27% 客服执行 0.70% 0.70% 0.50% 0.60% 0.10% 0.10% 0.07% 0.20% 0.20% 0.30% 0.40% 1.10% 3.80% 7.60% 9.10% 7.30% 11.00% 9.20% 小计 48% 54% 53% 54% 47% 33% 29% 27% 32% 31% 28% 27% 30% 37% 39% 37% 38% 36% 酒店执行 AI调度酒店执行 48% 43% 43% 43% 50% 64% 67% 68% 64% 65% 67% 68% 64% 46% 48% 48% 51% 50% 客服调度\n**发件人：**\n英宁 <­yingning@delonixmail.com­>\n**时间：**\n2026-04-07T08:22:53.065Z（2026-04-07T08:22:53.065Z）2026-04-07T08:22:53.065Z\n</card>","sender":{"id":"ou_42cf24dd179f2f2ef36952cab65f5aee","sender_type":"user","name":"方源兵"},"create_time":"2026-04-07T16:35:20+08:00","deleted":false,"updated":false},{"message_id":"om_x100b52070a0fd0b8b295ec3e2ceae50","msg_type":"text","content":"@阿荣高娃 已提交","sender":{"id":"ou_0ac103d892d58424d2bffc1218bbea87","sender_type":"user","name":"孙丽雅"},"create_time":"2026-04-06T12:19:24+08:00","deleted":false,"updated":true,"reply_to":"om_x100b5213673790a4c427448684c16b4","mentions":[{"key":"@_user_1","id":"ou_8eaf04dc184ff7cc132f7c9c81d4b1ed","name":"阿荣高娃"}]},{"message_id":"om_x100b5213673790a4c427448684c16b4","msg_type":"post","content":"@严狄炜 @孙丽雅 @周俊楼 @吴兴梅 @许玉燕 @范群英 @吴燕飞 @王豪 @黄杰波 @俞利军 @罗婷婷 @李昆 @秦涛 @邵世骏 @晁留柱 @廖鸣  @蔡炬炯 各位虫洞总经理好，\n关于**APP保有率日报**，下方表格中的空白单元格表示当日未提交。麻烦各位总经理在**明天中午前**完成补交(留意入住房单、未入住房单数据，需与大数据系统保持一致；APP保有率日期选择补交日期）。\n![image](img_v3_0210f_cadc578e-9766-4dde-9d52-86574acacd5g)\n@周俊楼 @廖鸣 @孙丽雅 几位总经理请留意，酒店似乎还没有开始提交日报，麻烦在明天中午前补齐**3月29日**起的日报。\n\n感谢各位的配合！\n日报提交链接（也已在群置顶）：[https://delonix.feishu.cn/share/base/form/shrcnGRogJddt5EH91rT4ZlB8dM](https://delonix.feishu.cn/share/base/form/shrcnGRogJddt5EH91rT4ZlB8dM)","sender":{"id":"ou_8eaf04dc184ff7cc132f7c9c81d4b1ed","sender_type":"user","name":"阿荣高娃"},"create_time":"2026-04-05T22:33:03+08:00","deleted":false,"updated":true,"mentions":[{"key":"@_user_1","id":"ou_08434cf688e76c1a426c59b2907d921a","name":"严狄炜"},{"key":"@_user_2","id":"ou_0ac103d892d58424d2bffc1218bbea87","name":"孙丽雅"},{"key":"@_user_3","id":"ou_7dca5929a2d577e4c6bfca3b9e08a9ef","name":"周俊楼"},{"key":"@_user_4","id":"ou_76d606700aadeb9625c8e9ace6ac2db4","name":"吴兴梅"},{"key":"@_user_5","id":"ou_4ba0f0eef1f1bac154279ce7c704c5cb","name":"许玉燕"},{"key":"@_user_6","id":"ou_829fca3fe999787d809495589d176a3b","name":"范群英"},{"key":"@_user_7","id":"ou_e52bc27e6d9d88067c16854ce67fd1a8","name":"吴燕飞"},{"key":"@_user_8","id":"ou_7c5d38b44f5d7703cb493e9d3c9f050a","name":"王豪"},{"key":"@_user_9","id":"ou_d845e8543ad72f4385df6b0bd22f15b5","name":"黄杰波