0b53ce4aaf38bcc427546c6caa137","msg_type":"interactive","content":"<card title=\"【日报】虫洞门店服务日报（4.2）\">\nDear all： 以下为虫洞（4.2）数据收集情况，请查收。 一、住中AI数据分析 1、数据概览（仅计入国内虫洞数据） 虫洞直营店 指标 数据 4.2 4.1 神灯使用 酒店数 29 29 神灯活跃对话房间数 2,110 2,050 反馈总量 4,895 4,781 神灯活跃率 55% 63% 工单执行 客服与AI执行 AI执行 50% 51% 客服执行 0.5% 0.6% 小计 50% 52% 酒店执行 AI调度 46% 45% 客服调度 3.7% 3.7% 小计 50% 48% 虫洞委托店 指标 数据 4.2 4.1 神灯使用 酒店数 21 21 神灯活跃对话房间数 922 849 反馈总量 2,621 2,327 神灯活跃率 39% 39% 工单执行 客服与AI执行 AI执行 44% 47% 客服执行 0.6% 0.3% 小计 45% 48% 酒店执行 AI调度 51% 48% 客服调度 4.5% 4.1% 小计 56% 52% 洞1 指标 数据 4.2 4.1 神灯使用 酒店数 47 47 神灯上线酒店数（40%） 19 19 神灯活跃对话房间数 1,503 1,463 反馈总量 4,375 4,246 神灯活跃率 49.8% 61.3% 工单执行 客服与AI执行 AI执行 43% 45% 客服执行 0.4% 0.6% 小计 44% 45% 酒店执行 AI调度 52% 51% 客服调度 4.4% 3.9% 小计 56% 55% 洞2 指标 数据 4.2 4.1 神灯使用 酒店数 33 33 神灯上线酒店数（21%） 7 7 神灯活跃对话房间数 382 307 反馈总量 963 824 神灯活跃率 39.6% 38.1% 工单执行 客服与AI执行 AI执行 38% 43% 客服执行 0.4% 0.5% 小计 38% 43% 酒店执行 AI调度 57% 53% 客服调度 5.2% 3.2% 小计 62% 57% 洞3 指标 数据 4.2 4.1 神灯使用 酒店数 45 45 神灯上线酒店数（7%） 3 3 神灯活跃对话房间数 68 73 反馈总量 128 137 神灯活跃率 20.9% 22.2% 工单执行 客服与AI执行 AI执行 62% 61% 客服执行 1.6% 0.0% 小计 63% 61% 酒店执行 AI调度 29% 33% 客服调度 7.8% 6.\n**发件人：**\n英宁 <­yingning@delonixmail.com­>\n**时间：**\n2026-04-03T10:09:21.907Z（2026-04-03T10:09:21.907Z）2026-04-03T10:09:21.907Z\n</card>","sender":{"id":"ou_42cf24dd179f2f2ef36952cab65f5aee","sender_type":"user","name":"方源兵"},"create_time":"2026-04-03T19:11:02+08:00","deleted":false,"updated":false},{"message_id":"om_x100b53c33dae1084c33b056bc65dea8","msg_type":"post","content":"各位虫洞总经理好，@严狄炜 @孙丽雅 @周俊楼 @吴兴梅 @许玉燕 @范群英 @吴燕飞 @王豪 @黄杰波 @俞利军 @罗婷婷 @李昆 @秦涛 @邵世骏 @晁留柱 @廖鸣  \n\n为提升客户体验、优化内部管理，现需大家进行两项简单动作，**4月10日前**完成即可，感谢支持！\n\n**一、反馈虫洞服务问题（提升运营流畅度）**\n请在4.10前将虫洞相关系统（神灯、AI PMS、工单等）的所有问题和建议，通过飞书发给数字员工“阿拉丁”（飞书搜索“阿拉丁”，直接发送消息）。内容需包含：场景、问题/建议、频率、图片/视频。\n示例：\n- 场景：客人预抵准备\n- 具体问题/建议：客人备注客房特殊要求后，AI分析信息并直接生成工单，提前准备房间物品\n- 发生频率：每天\n- 截图/视频：请附相关图片（如有）\n\n欢迎积极反馈！\n\n**二、试用前厅“AI陪练”（节省培训时间，提升话术水平）**\n为了提升前厅话术水平，同时节约前厅管理人员的培训时间，目前已上线“AI陪练”网站，邀请各虫洞酒店试用。\n详细介绍请见：[AI陪练网站使用说明](https://delonix.feishu.cn/docx/H2V5dbaHPodfqaximIxcO6SHn2b?from=from_copylink)。4.10前将试用问题/建议同样发给“阿拉丁”\n\n账号开通：\n1. 已为各酒店开通管理员账号（见[虫洞一组-管理员账号](https://delonix.feishu.cn/share/base/dashboard/shrcnr1sSjco4v60TIkyqCCr9Rp))，管理员可为酒店员工开通账号\n![image](img_v3_0210d_4400d09d-3aa3-41cd-b39d-c8d3ae8e9a2g)\n2. 员工可登录网站使用AI陪练：[https://m6p8qcx37v.coze.site/](https://m6p8qcx37v.coze.site/)\n\n各位的反馈能直接推动虫洞服务提升，AI陪练可大幅降低前厅培训成本。期待各位的积极反馈","sender":{"id":"ou_8eaf04dc184ff7cc132f7c9c81d4b1ed","sender_type":"user","name":"阿荣高娃"},"create_time":"2026-04-03T16:15:50+08:00","deleted":false,"updated":true,"mentions":[{"key":"@_user_1","id":"ou_08434cf688e76c1a426c59b2907d921a","name":"严狄炜"},{"key":"@_user_2","id":"ou_0ac103d892d58424d2bffc1218bbea87","name":"孙丽雅"},{"key":"@_user_3","id":"ou_7dca5929a2d577e4c6bfca3b9e08a9ef","name":"周俊楼"},{"key":"@_user_4","id":"ou_76d606700aadeb9625c8e9ace6ac2db4","name":"吴兴梅"},{"key":"@_user_5","id":"ou_4ba0f0eef1f1bac154279ce7c704c5cb","name":"许玉燕"},{"key":"@_user_6","id":"ou_829fca3fe999787d809495589d176a3b","name":"范群英"},{"key":"@_user_7","id":"ou_e52bc27e6d9d88067c16854ce67fd1a8","name":"吴燕飞"},{"key":"@_user_8","id":"ou_7c5d38b44f5d7703cb493e9d3c9f050a","name":"王豪"},{"key":"@_user_9","id":"ou_d845e8543ad72f4385df6b0bd22f15b5","name":"黄杰波"},{"key":"@_user_10","id":"ou_cfad75d1e6e4b69aeb14b89610da8a6a","name":"俞利军"},{"key":"@_user_11","id":"ou_8e68b9f319ee93eb80bea1a7ae69728c","name":"罗婷婷"},{"key":"@_user_12","id":"ou_41c1de197bed6caab041d6deb2ee5456","name":"李昆"},{"key":"@_user_13","id":"ou_3d993b85fafb91f74a797de13dabd0c4","name":"秦涛"},{"key":"@_user_14","id":"ou_76134d6ecd00e7740a8c330d2050078a","name":"邵世骏"},{"key":"@_user_15","id":"ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409","name":"晁留柱"},{"key":"@_user_16","id":"ou_af0d6b70d460d807f1489ebdaf162f36","name":"廖鸣"}]},{"message_id":"om_x100b53c02a5da4b4c456a9fda55797b","msg_type":"text","content":"收到","sender":{"id":"ou_8195e8038b4c59a044a11c38aa990814","sender_type":"user","name":"姚芸"},"create_time":"2026-04-03T12:47:05+08:00","deleted":false,"updated":false}],"has_more":true,"page_token":"4cXSlmN7uFAnWWU5yfIGMD40iovA0d0qql9-uNJmQK2hDLyG7Tu71tUnyt-hh_SqCjMJtrbeKzjLKi-6pOAkmVnNIjZKdHJ4gwLDL63zLK_eZHwQykjCYI7Me6Ch5ghh"},"isError":false,"timestamp":1775624577126}}
{"type":"message","id":"9520bd46","parentId":"6c1e9e32","timestamp":"2026-04-08T05:02:57.130Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_function_6n9x42jg8gxi_4","toolName":"feishu_im_user_get_messages","content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\n  \"messages\": [\n    {\n      \"message_id\": \"om_x100b520eabe410a0c117db31c9785df\",\n      \"msg_type\": \"post\",\n      \"content\": \"![image](img_v3_0210g_abfce9a5-032a-4bd9-9b85-11316113e83g)\\n![image](img_v3_0210g_4151f190-cdc7-49b8-8a72-f681e72e1dag)\\n关于这个工单我在知识库补充了一个一次性马桶垫的问答\",\n      \"sender\": {\n        \"id\": \"ou_df304985e8d294fb8052e01ffb8d5501\",\n        \"sender_type\": \"user\",\n        \"name\": \"张婉婷\"\n      },\n      \"create_time\": \"2026-04-06T21:00:02+08:00\",\n      \"deleted\": false,\n      \"updated\": false\n    },\n    {\n      \"message_id\": \"om_x100b52025b8d186cc44b284357e6275\",\n      \"msg_type\": \"text\",\n      \"content\": \"好的，那麻烦MOD电话以后注意保持电话畅通\",\n      \"sender\": {\n        \"id\": \"ou_e650c72bb2704ab224a1c2977188866b\",\n        \"sender_type\": \"user\",\n        \"name\": \"林广辉\"\n      },\n      \"create_time\": \"2026-04-06T15:31:32+08:00\",\n      \"deleted\": false,\n      \"updated\": false\n    },\n    {\n      \"message_id\": \"om_x100b52025caeeca4c2e1f80ad69ac86\",\n      \"msg_type\": \"text\",\n      \"content\": \"@林广辉 第一个电话正在维修，第二个电话可以接通\",\n      \"sender\": {\n        \"id\": \"ou_030cf497a5d422b7f507c422bb9aca65\",\n        \"sender_type\": \"user\",\n        \"name\": \"田静\"\n      },\n      \"create_time\": \"2026-04-06T15:30:46+08:00\",\n      \"deleted\": false,\n      \"updated\": true,\n      \"reply_to\": \"om_x100b5201abcf80a0c146c61f687c99e\",\n      \"mentions\": [\n        {\n          \"key\": \"@_user_1\",\n          \"id\": \"ou_e650c72bb2704ab224a1c2977188866b\",\n          \"name\": \"林广辉\"\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"message_id\": \"om_x100b5201ab6804a4c2eaed54068f839\",\n      \"msg_type\": \"text\",\n      \"content\": \"我核实下\",\n      \"sender\": {\n        \"id\": \"ou_030cf497a5d422b7f507c422bb9aca65\",\n        \"sender_type\": \"user\",\n        \"name\": \"田静\"\n      },\n      \"create_time\": \"2026-04-06T15:18:50+08:00\",\n      \"deleted\": false,\n      \"updated\": false\n    },\n    {\n      \"message_id\": \"om_x100b5201abcf80a0c146c61f687c99e\",\n      \"msg_type\": \"text\",\n      \"content\": \"这个电话我联系很多天都打不通了，如果更换了号码，麻烦在系统上更改一下，谢谢\",\n      \"sender\": {\n        \"id\": \"ou_e650c72bb2704ab224a1c2977188866b\",\n        \"sender_type\": \"user\",\n        \"name\": \"林广辉\"\n      },\n      \"create_time\": \"2026-04-06T15:18:40+08:00\",\n      \"deleted\": false,\n      \"updated\": false\n    },\n    {\n      \"message_id\": \"om_x100b5201acfab4a0c34770ec0ef9dca\",\n      \"msg_type\": \"text\",\n      \"content\": \"你们现在MOD还是这个电话么\",\n      \"sender\": {\n        \"id\": \"ou_e650c72bb2704ab224a1c2977188866b\",\n        \"sender_type\": \"user\",\n        \"name\": \"林广辉\"\n      },\n      \"create_time\": \"2026-04-06T15:17:55+08:00\",\n      \"deleted\": false,\n      \"updated\": false\n    },\n    {\n      \"message_id\": \"om_x100b5201af55fca8c2c4dc35a1052af\",\n      \"msg_type\": \"image\",\n      \"content\": \"![image](img_v3_0210g_ac120002-8d33-449c-8936-564e2e95453g)\",\n      \"sender\": {\n        \"id\": \"ou_e650c72bb2704ab224a1c2977188866b\",\n        \"sender_type\": \"user\",\n        \"name\": \"林广辉\"\n      },\n      \"create_time\": \"2026-04-06T15:17:45+08:00\",\n      \"deleted\": false,\n      \"updated\": false\n    },\n    {\n      \"message_id\": \"om_x100b5201904720a0c4e4433f455f585\",\n      \"msg_type\": \"text\",\n      \"content\": \"@林广辉 @田静 MOD迅速推进\",\n      \"sender\": {\n        \"id\": \"ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409\",\n        \"sender_type\": \"user\",\n        \"name\": \"晁留柱\"\n      },\n      \"create_time\": \"2026-04-06T15:16:56+08:00\",\n      \"deleted\": false,\n      \"updated\": true,\n      \"reply_to\": \"om_x100b5201851018a8c2c54c561d8f494\",\n      \"mentions\": [\n        {\n          \"key\": \"@_user_1\",\n          \"id\": \"ou_e650c72bb2704ab224a1c2977188866b\",\n          \"name\": \"林广辉\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"key\": \"@_user_2\",\n          \"id\": \"ou_030cf497a5d422b7f507c422bb9aca65\",\n          \"name\": \"田静\"\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"message_id\": \"om_x100b520180e060a4c1194651f15a50d\",\n      \"msg_type\": \"image\",\n      \"content\": \"![image](img_v3_0210g_0f80a2ce-c09b-43ee-9f55-a7e2abe58c6g)\",\n      \"sender\": {\n        \"id\": \"ou_e650c72bb2704ab224a1c2977188866b\",\n        \"sender_type\": \"user\",\n        \"name\": \"林广辉\"\n      },\n      \"create_time\": \"2026-04-06T15:12:35+08:00\",\n      \"deleted\": false,\n      \"updated\": false\n    },\n    {\n      \"message_id\": \"om_x100b5201851018a8c2c54c561d8f494\",\n      \"msg_type\": \"text\",\n      \"content\": \"2005的顾客要求帮他送一下他的外卖，多次联系酒店显示”暂时联系不到联系人”状态，麻烦酒店及时安排服务员进行配送，并检查电话线路情况保持电话畅通\",\n      \"sender\": {\n        \"id\": \"ou_e650c72bb2704ab224a1c2977188866b\",\n        \"sender_type\": \"user\",\n        \"name\": \"林广辉\"\n      },\n      \"create_time\": \"2026-04-06T15:11:57+08:00\",\n      \"deleted\": false,\n      \"updated\": false\n    },\n    {\n      \"message_id\": \"om_x100b521602dc18a8c42453b80529702\",\n      \"msg_type\": \"interactive\",\n      \"content\": \"<card title=\\\"紧急/投诉工单台账填写提醒\\\">\\n目前有紧急|投诉工单尚未填写处理结果，辛苦酒店各负责人尽快填写，谢谢！\\n\\n\\n[台账填写](https://delonix.feishu.cn/base/Etl0bbQ0XahkaTsaP3gcZsvmnZg?from=from_copylink&ccm_open_type=im_card_workflow_button)\\n---\\n来自 [虫洞工单台账](https://delonix.feishu.cn/base/Etl0bbQ0XahkaTsaP3gcZsvmnZg?ccm_open_type=im_card_workflow_link)\\n</card>\",\n      \"sender\": {\n        \"id\": \"cli_a903c4bc0f389bc9\",\n        \"sender_type\": \"app\"\n      },\n      \"create_time\": \"2026-04-05T17:00:49+08:00\",\n      \"deleted\": false,\n      \"updated\": false\n    },\n    {\n      \"message_id\": \"om_x100b52167e84e4a4c2a656705fb1958\",\n      \"msg_type\": \"interactive\",\n      \"content\": \"<card title=\\\"紧急/投诉工单台账填写通知\\\">\\n任务：紧急/投诉工单处理结果填写\\n时限：当天17：30前\\n要求：详细填写处理的过程和结果，不能只填“已处理“”已完成“”已联系“等情况不明的描述。\\n今天需填写的工单已更新，辛苦酒店各负责人点击下方[台账填写]按钮，根据实际情况详细填写[处理结果]，谢谢！\\n[台账填写](https://delonix.feishu.cn/base/Etl0bbQ0XahkaTsaP3gcZsvmnZg?from=from_copylink&ccm_open_type=im_card_workflow_button)\\n---\\n</card>\",\n      \"sender\": {\n        \"id\": \"cli_a903c4bc0f389bc9\",\n        \"sender_type\": \"app\"\n      },\n      \"create_time\": \"2026-04-05T16:53:24+08:00\",\n      \"deleted\": false,\n      \"updated\": false\n    },\n    {\n      \"message_id\": \"om_x100b53d0710460bcb4b86b43a30de39\",\n      \"msg_type\": \"interactive\",\n      \"content\": \"<card title=\\\"Ai PMS功能更新通知-2026/04/02\\\">\\n更新信息如下：\\n1、最后更新日期：2026-04-02\\n2、最后更新人：韩恩恩\\n3、最后更新内容：更新章节：第四章：Ai PMS系统其他能力。内容：PAD 端 Ai PMS 选房页面重磅升级，房间号选择全面AI化，根据用户喜好，由神灯决策最佳房间号\\n\\n详细内容请前往操作手册查看：\\n[https://delonix.feishu.cn/wiki/MWuAwgQYHiOfdtk9Y3WcZNWcn2g](https://delonix.feishu.cn/wiki/MWuAwgQYHiOfdtk9Y3WcZNWcn2g)\\n~~~~~~~~~\\n本消息由AI自动生成，如有疑问联系【韩恩恩】\\n---\\n来自 [德胧生态小助手（通知）](https://delonix.feishu.cn/base/HiaUbqSsLav0BnsQWEactEennxb?ccm_open_type=im_card_workflow_link)\\n</card>\",\n      \"sender\": {\n        \"id\": \"ou_b6c4c2b5f63d677c8927c51b263d0f44\",\n        \"sender_type\": \"user\",\n        \"name\": \"韩恩恩\"\n      },\n      \"create_time\": \"2026-04-02T18:25:00+08:00\",\n      \"deleted\": false,\n      \"updated\": false\n    },\n    {\n      \"message_id\": \"om_x100b538dbc5c60a8b4b2bdfa621dd09\",\n      \"msg_type\": \"text\",\n      \"content\": \"嗯嗯。刚刚应该还是未入住的那个团队订单的提示。\",\n      \"sender\": {\n        \"id\": \"ou_c536828caccac6955566810eaf0fec82\",\n        \"sender_type\": \"user\",\n        \"name\": \"阳鹏\"\n      },\n      \"create_time\": \"2026-03-31T18:17:13+08:00\",\n      \"deleted\": false,\n      \"updated\": false\n    },\n    {\n      \"message_id\": \"om_x100b538da1b4b488b3dd0347d8e766d\",\n      \"msg_type\": \"text\",\n      \"content\": \"刚重新试验，发现可以了，谢谢\",\n      \"sender\": {\n        \"id\": \"ou_1ea58f21699b6576cd93c65ffbc1c22a\",\n        \"sender_type\": \"user\",\n        \"name\": \"刘东东\"\n      },\n      \"create_time\": \"2026-03-31T18:16:23+08:00\",\n      \"deleted\": false,\n      \"updated\": false\n    },\n    {\n      \"message_id\": \"om_x100b538d8f51f8a0c29d4b0226f9f1a\",\n      \"msg_type\": \"text\",\n      \"content\": \"@刘东东 哪个不可以。。\",\n      \"sender\": {\n        \"id\": \"ou_c536828caccac6955566810eaf0fec82\",\n        \"sender_type\": \"user\",\n        \"name\": \"阳鹏\"\n      },\n      \"create_time\": \"2026-03-31T18:04:09+08:00\",\n      \"deleted\": false,\n      \"updated\": true,\n      \"reply_to\": \"om_x100b538de4fa6d6cb494c5e8611d29c\",\n      \"mentions\": [\n        {\n          \"key\": \"@_user_1\",\n          \"id\": \"ou_1ea58f21699b6576cd93c65ffbc1c22a\",\n          \"name\": \"刘东东\"\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"message_id\": \"om_x100b538d8feb68a4c2ae2ff16fe5603\",\n      \"msg_type\": \"text\",\n      \"content\": \"然后刚刚\\t\\n03-31 18:02:52.126 查询的国内码，也是正常返回。。\",\n      \"sender\": {\n        \"id\": \"ou_c536828caccac6955566810eaf0fec82\",\n        \"sender_type\": \"user\",\n        \"name\": \"阳鹏\"\n      },\n      \"create_time\": \"2026-03-31T18:04:02+08:00\",\n      \"deleted\": false,\n      \"updated\": false\n    },\n    {\n      \"message_id\": \"om_x100b538d8ee88ca4c30198d6b8b5bc5\",\n      \"msg_type\": \"text\",\n      \"content\": \"51分查询的订单：26033030528316 时间：03-31 17:51:11.030  ，这订单订单是R状态，用的海外会员吗。因为是现付订单，无法办理入住。\\n然后57分查询的订单：26033130567597 时间：03-31 17:57:03.042，这个订单是I状态订单。用的国内会员码。正常返回。\",\n      \"sender\": {\n        \"id\": \"ou_c536828caccac6955566810eaf0fec82\",\n        \"sender_type\": \"user\",\n        \"name\": \"阳鹏\"\n      },\n      \"create_time\": \"2026-03-31T18:03:46+08:00\",\n      \"deleted\": false,\n      \"update