{"type":"message","id":"74e0c1dc","parentId":"af216aba","timestamp":"2026-04-08T05:03:25.275Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now I have data from 7 key groups. Let me analyze what's new since the 12:02 check:\n\n**TJ-酒店客房预订群 (oc_fe89d2c0436adf59c54747a10131a045)**:\n- 12:01 - 夏美娟发火箭军VIP新订单（两间海河套，380含早晚餐自付）✅ Already learned at 12:02\n- 12:48:22 - 张惠发了张图片（image）\n- 12:48:27 - 张惠发了\"改名\"（reply to the image）\n\n\n- These messages from 12:48 are new and weren't captured in the 12:02 learning session, so I need to mark this group for learning the updated reservation order with the name change included.\n\n**TJ-酒店市场工作沟通开壳群 (oc_10122aa30da1d9bc64b365dadb3b6dbb)**:\n- Most recent messages are from 10:13, already learned at 11:02\n- No new messages since 11:02\n\n**虫洞一组总经理沟通群 (oc_4e890ccbd87ec2216e47c009e523676d)**:\n- 09:28 - 张春雷发送周度绩效预警数据 (already learned at earlier check)\n- No new messages after 09:28\n\n**AI虫洞项目-天津瑞湾开元名都酒店 (oc_8441e560e0223c30832dd17190e6469f)**:\n- Latest: 4月6日21:00 - 张婉婷补充一次性马桶垫问答 (older)\n- No new messages in the last hour\n\n**TJ-ai虫洞晨夕会纪要群 (oc_8de0ee6c766105ebd6c47bb9c234bcf6)**:\n- Latest: 09:35 - auto doc post (already learned)\n- No new messages after 09:35\n\n**TJ-Ai虫洞会员市场核心群 (oc_4a9234b5a29bd6fd1dd950ff8004c87f)**:\n- Latest: 4月7日17:12 - 租户身份消息 (already learned)\n- No new messages\n\n**TJ-Ai虫洞工作效率提升群 (oc_7fbb3e67d82d905ffbee225f3a66d765)**:\n- 12:36 - Claw发送租户级授权培训文档\n- 07:08 - 差评处理相关讨论 (already learned)\n- 12:36 message is NEW - this is from Claw bot, a notification about tenant-level authorization training documentation\n\n. The group already has the workbuddy, gemini, 晁留柱的AI助手, and 腾讯云Openclaw bots added at 07:07, so this is just sharing information about tenant-level authorization training.\n\nActually, wait - I need to reconsider what's truly new since 12:02. Looking back at the booking group, 张惠's messages at 12:48 about a name change are genuinely new content that weren't captured in the earlier learning.\n\nSo my actual new messages are:\n1. TJ-酒店客房预订群: 张惠 12:48 \"改名\" (name change for an order - brief but new)\n2. TJ-Ai虫洞工作效率提升群: Claw 12:36 租户级授权培训文档通知\n\nThe name change message is too sparse to extract much beyond confirming there's an order modification happening, so I should check if there are other groups I haven't examined yet before finalizing what I've learned. Looking at the 12:48 message more carefully, I need to check the earlier message in the thread to understand what 张惠 is referring to with the name change request. The image message before it was sent at 12:48:22, so I should examine that original message to see what order information it contains.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"发现预订群有新消息，让我获取更多上下文：\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_lnp7k8lkuqsc_1","name":"feishu_im_user_get_messages","arguments":{"chat_id":"oc_fe89d2c0436adf59c54747a10131a045","end_time":"2026-04-08T13:00:00+08:00","page_size":20,"sort_rule":"create_time_desc","start_time":"2026-04-08T12:40:00+08:00"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_lnp7k8lkuqsc_2","name":"feishu_im_user_get_messages","arguments":{"chat_id":"oc_7fbb3e67d82d905ffbee225f3a66d765","end_time":"2026-04-08T13:00:00+08:00","page_size":10,"sort_rule":"create_time_desc","start_time":"2026-04-08T12:30:00+08:00"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"miaoda","model":"miaoda-model-auto","usage":{"input":85662,"output":1094,"cacheRead":891,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":87647,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1775624577137,"responseId":"chatcmpl-42ea7239-715f-48cc-aaa0-c74d81f32204"}}
