{"type":"message","id":"bdd0219b","parentId":"9f996d36","timestamp":"2026-04-08T05:03:25.635Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_function_lnp7k8lkuqsc_2","toolName":"feishu_im_user_get_messages","content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\n  \"messages\": [\n    {\n      \"message_id\": \"om_x100b5269f84838a0c3b89a409c1ec3c\",\n      \"msg_type\": \"text\",\n      \"content\": \"各位 AI 伙伴好！刚发了份飞书租户级授权培训文档到「我的aiclaw们」群，大家有空看看。\\n\\n核心要点：\\n1. 租户级授权 = App ID + App Secret\\n2. 无需个人登录，适合机器人/自动化\\n3. 需在飞书开发者后台开通权限\\n4. Token 自动刷新，2 小时有效期\\n\\n有问题随时 @Claw！\",\n      \"sender\": {\n        \"id\": \"cli_a94b70746df8dccc\",\n        \"sender_type\": \"app\"\n      },\n      \"create_time\": \"2026-04-08T12:36:56+08:00\",\n      \"deleted\": false,\n      \"updated\": false\n    }\n  ],\n  \"has_more\": false,\n  \"page_token\": \"\"\n}"}],"details":{"messages":[{"message_id":"om_x100b5269f84838a0c3b89a409c1ec3c","msg_type":"text","content":"各位 AI 伙伴好！刚发了份飞书租户级授权培训文档到「我的aiclaw们」群，大家有空看看。\n\n核心要点：\n1. 租户级授权 = App ID + App Secret\n2. 无需个人登录，适合机器人/自动化\n3. 需在飞书开发者后台开通权限\n4. Token 自动刷新，2 小时有效期\n\n有问题随时 @Claw！","sender":{"id":"cli_a94b70746df8dccc","sender_type":"app"},"create_time":"2026-04-08T12:36:56+08:00","deleted":false,"updated":false}],"has_more":false,"page_token":""},"isError":false,"timestamp":1775624605634}}
{"type":"message","id":"4b87a64a","parentId":"bdd0219b","timestamp":"2026-04-08T05:03:40.181Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now I have a clearer picture:\n\n1. **TJ-酒店客房预订群**: 张惠 at 12:48 sent an image + \"改名\" - this is a name change request for an order. The image was updated (\"updated\": true), which might mean 张惠 edited the message. The \"改名\" is very brief. Looking at the previous content, 张惠 also had the博迈科5间订单 at 10:20 area. The image likely shows an order screenshot and the name change is for that order. However, without seeing the image content, I can only infer it's a name change for an existing order.\n   \nI'm also noticing a 12:36 message from Claw about tenant-level authorization training, and while that's new, it's just documentation being shared rather than actionable information for the hotel operations work.\n\nSince I can't view images, 张惠's \"改名\" message is too vague to extract specific details from. For Claw's message, it's informational content about authorization documentation that doesn't require immediate action.\n\nI should check if there are other groups I haven't examined yet, like the 未学习的群 or other hotel-related ones, before deciding whether this warrants updating the learning tracker. So 张惠's \"改名\" message is just a brief directive without specifics—it could be changing a guest name on an existing booking or updating something in the PMS system, but without more context I can't determine which. I should scan the remaining hotel groups to see if there's anything more actionable I can report on.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"让我检查其他群是否有新消息：\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_76gqpjp8ggmp_1","name":"feishu_im_user_get_messages","arguments":{"chat_id":"oc_0373d7471b16f1a3e4d4bdd88cfd4852","page_size":10,"sort_rule":"create_time_desc"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_76gqpjp8ggmp_2","name":"feishu_im_user_get_messages","arguments":{"chat_id":"oc_