{"type":"message","id":"8824de75","parentId":"98d1b591","timestamp":"2026-04-08T05:03:41.523Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_function_76gqpjp8ggmp_3","toolName":"feishu_im_user_get_messages","content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\n  \"messages\": [\n    {\n      \"message_id\": \"om_x100b527cc67864a4b2bf571322b7b17\",\n      \"msg_type\": \"system\",\n      \"content\": \"徐玉敏 joined the group via a QR Code shared by 李昱. New members can view all chat history.\",\n      \"sender\": {\n        \"id\": \"\",\n        \"sender_type\": \"\"\n      },\n      \"create_time\": \"2026-04-07T12:31:07+08:00\",\n      \"deleted\": false,\n      \"updated\": false\n    },\n    {\n      \"message_id\": \"om_x100b523281cff8a8b31ea8509de6cfd\",\n      \"msg_type\": \"system\",\n      \"content\": \"阿荣高娃 invited 蔡炬炯 to the group. New members can view all chat history.\",\n      \"sender\": {\n        \"id\": \"\",\n        \"sender_type\": \"\"\n      },\n      \"create_time\": \"2026-04-04T09:44:16+08:00\",\n      \"deleted\": false,\n      \"updated\": false\n    },\n    {\n      \"message_id\": \"om_x100b53c93a0370a8c4e8fb85b138a49\",\n      \"msg_type\": \"post\",\n      \"content\": \"针对可蓝牙开门的酒店，新增“手机即房卡”物料，各位总经理可以根据酒店情况自行取用\\n\\n![image](img_v3_0210d_4ce48692-dcf4-4a15-97d1-3fcba4b9a46g)\\n\\n分别有竖版及横版，详情见：[百达屋会员标准物料 -2026](https://delonix.feishu.cn/wiki/UC76wJSVViBNm9kiAQccDflDnAb)\",\n      \"sender\": {\n        \"id\": \"ou_8eaf04dc184ff7cc132f7c9c81d4b1ed\",\n        \"sender_type\": \"user\",\n        \"name\": \"阿荣高娃\"\n      },\n      \"create_time\": \"2026-04-03T23:05:49+08:00\",\n      \"deleted\": false,\n      \"updated\": false\n    },\n    {\n      \"message_id\": \"om_x100b53c96fd430a4c33a1faa8c3fd89\",\n      \"msg_type\": \"system\",\n      \"content\": \"李昱 invited 王飞, 张有志, 任涛 to the group. New members can view all chat history.\",\n      \"sender\": {\n        \"id\": \"\",\n        \"sender_type\": \"\"\n      },\n      \"create_time\": \"20