{"type":"message","id":"2ff31bb2","parentId":"8824de75","timestamp":"2026-04-08T05:04:00.200Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now I have a comprehensive picture of the messages since 12:02. Let me analyze:\n\n**TJ-酒店客房预订群 (12:48 new)**:\n- 张惠 12:48 发送了一张图片 + \"改名\"（回复图片）\n- This is a name change request for an order. The image was edited (\"updated\": true)\n- This is new content since the 12:02 check\n- 张惠 had earlier sent the博迈科5间订单 at ~10:20 area, so this name change is likely related to that order\n\n**TJ-Ai虫洞工作效率提升群 (12:36 new)**:\n\n\n- Claw shared a 飞书租户级授权培训 document with key points about tenant-level authorization using App ID + App Secret, which doesn't require personal login and is suitable for bot/automation scenarios\n- This requires permissions to be enabled in the Feishu developer backend, though the document itself is more of an informational announcement than actionable content\n\nFor the hotel groups, the 中国开元名都事业部酒店房务群 has an older message about a knowledge base link from 4/7 15:54, while TJ-酒店外围状态群 only shows image content from 段乔云 at 4/7 13:51.\n\nLooking at the newer messages across groups, the 虫洞酒店-更新发布群 has a new member announcement from 4/7 12:31 that was already noted in earlier checks. Most of the 13:00 messages are just routine mentions of 晁留柱 in various groups.\n\nThe key new finding is the booking order modification at 12:48 where 张惠 requested a name change on an order, though without seeing the image content I can't determine exactly what changed. There's also the 租户级授权 training document from Claw at 12:36, but that's primarily informational rather than actionable. I'm checking if there are any other hotel groups I should be tracking, but looking at the 已学习群 list, it seems I've covered the main ones that are active. The key findings are a name change request from 张惠 in the booking group and the tenant authorization training document from Claw in the work efficiency group. Since these are minor additions and the image context is unclear, I'll document them as brief notes in the tracker rather than updating the daily memory.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"分析完毕，发现两处新消息。现在更新追踪记录：\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_3nlvmqr0jg7t_1","name":"read","arguments":{"limit":5,"offset":1,"path":"/home/gem/workspace/agent/workspace/memory/group-learning-tracker.md"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"miaoda","model":"miaoda-model-auto","usage":{"input":7153,"output":556,"cacheRead":86459,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":94168,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1775624621526,"responseId":"chatcmpl-8f37bb97-7fde-4238-a6ca-b32fc16bf6c0"}}
